<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-function">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.GetLocalRot(): rotation`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`rotation llGetLocalRot();`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns the rotation of the prim <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#Local" target="_blank">relative</a> to the root.</p>
  <p>If called from the root prim, it returns the objects rotation.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Categories</div>
      <ul class="meta-list">
        <li>prim</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Tech Specs</div>
